OL,3,GNEWSAPublic safety concerns raised over
OL,4,Ae-scooters trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FSafety concerns have been raised about
OL,7,Fthe use of e-scooters as part of a
OL,8,Ftrial in four towns in Cornwall.
OL,10,FAbout 175 vehicles are being piloted
OL,11,Facross Penzance, Newquay, Falmouth and
OL,12,FTruro after the trial was launched in
OL,13,FJune.
OL,15,FBusinesses in Newquay have raised fears
OL,16,Fover the vehicles being driven too fast
OL,17,Fand recklessly around parts of the town
OL,18,Fcentre.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
