OL,3,GNEWSAPublic safety concerns raised over
OL,4,Ae-scooters trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeryl, the company which manages the
OL,7,Fscooters, said safety restrictions were
OL,8,Fin place and they had not had any real
OL,9,Fissues since they launched.
